{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0353_1000_p", "source_sha256": "20b3ad9e4491fdd759f842294aae9252b5a888860aca2a0e559932cb6860df08", "ja": "（アイドルたちの密着取材は順調に進んでいる。\nとはいえ、やはり緊張はするみたいだな……）", "zh": "（对偶像们的跟拍采访进行得很顺利。不过，她们果然还是会紧张啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0353_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "79a0f465a06ea6881655987fa938823e1ac114407fcfd54edd3e75b9fdbbda40", "ja": "ふぅ……あっ、お疲れさまです！\n{$P$}さん、今から休憩ですか？", "zh": "呼……啊，辛苦了！\n{$P$}先生，现在要休息吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0353_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7523720d1b0650c6701711a9b4310fb8e44380b89c1a1007dfea292af9a4e5fb", "ja": "ああ、そうだよ。春香も今から休みか？\nちょっと疲れてるみたいだな。", "zh": "嗯，是啊。春香你也要休息了吗？\n你好像有点累了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0353_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "bd73da1ff172f5b72a7c2611a1ad0df3e135e315a06f91b5beb85d41ee47a856", "ja": "あはは……そうなんです。普段のままでって、\n意識すればするほど、力が入っちゃうみたいで。", "zh": "啊哈哈……是的。越是提醒自己要保持平常的样子，反而越容易紧张起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0353_1004_p", "source_sha256": "614c7368e6761bfebf9f264c158dd70b4332a6957ebc34efcc89295ec9940056", "ja": "そうだろうなぁ……密着取材は大変だろうけど、\nもう少しだけ頑張ってもらえると助かるよ。", "zh": "确实如此……贴身采访虽然辛苦，但要是能再稍微努力一下，就帮大忙了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0353_1005_001har", "source_sha256": "28ab24e3a0d85deaf58419d4f9f607b637adc8c2bf13dd18dc10760c434a5701", "ja": "はいっ、任せてください！\nみんなと一緒なら、全然大丈夫ですよ。", "zh": "好的，交给我吧！\n只要和大家在一起，就完全没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0353_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "9a1dd773c2607c036bf9afc942c0100ab5c6c04608ba9281728e11f113478507", "ja": "みんなのインタビューを聞いてて、私、思い出し\nたんです。私たちの仲間が増えるって聞いた時のこと。", "zh": "听了大家的采访，我想起了一件事。\n就是当初听说我们的伙伴要变多的时候。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0353_1007_001har", "source_sha256": "a4a1995142676ef488f183c8069ff63eaad1cc8c00423f7712e162f41776d370", "ja": "あれって、まだ劇場が完成する前でしたよね？\n765プロの極秘事業だ、って。", "zh": "那时候还是剧场完工之前吧？听说是765制作人的绝密计划来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0353_1008_p", "source_sha256": "2c8e72780663b3833afba859fa7864c1e158726e903d9d1fee5467b357d09b60", "ja": "ああ……。\n劇場のオープンに向けて、忙しかった頃だな。", "zh": "啊……是剧场开幕前那段忙碌的日子啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0353_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "1a276e9814b049c5e6990b43a6634c1cc3caee95e3c762f6a860d433241409e0", "ja": "はい。私たちと同じ気持ちの仲間が、たくさん\n増える……劇場は、そんな素敵な場所になるって。", "zh": "是的。这里会成为一个让越来越多与我们怀着同样心情的伙伴……聚集起来的美好地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0353_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "078bea74ff3227aff5bf11fdec2290a858c29d26e6882bf9049b061baa98aad9", "ja": "本当にそんな場所になってるんだなって思ったら、\nなんだかじーんとしてきちゃって。えへへ。", "zh": "想到真的变成了那样的地方，就不知不觉有些感动起来了。嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0353_1011_p", "source_sha256": "7871f540f2939e92ab60887527b91a51302d156e9b28871d8b2a4e2e48dbe22e", "ja": "そうだな。なんとかスタートしたけど……\nまだまだアイドルの道のりは長いからな。", "zh": "是啊。虽然总算是起步了……但偶像之路还很漫长呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0353_1012_001har", "source_sha256": "1757705b9a3f757f7f65aaf5f2c5cb66c96e6552f26e23be48e19ef4fcb95a41", "ja": "そうですね♪　私も、もっともっと頑張らなきゃ！\nみんなと一緒に、ずっと走っていけるように……。", "zh": "是呀♪我也必须更加努力才行！\n为了能和大家一起，一直走下去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0353_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "91012f4871b1f9325817d2dd4b2a4c68de4eed5e87dcc4f7a6109e02256c3ff1", "ja": "だから{$P$}さん、見ててください。\nこれからの私たちのことを。", "zh": "所以，{$P$}先生，请继续看着我们。\n请注视今后的我们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0353_1014_p", "source_sha256": "384b0281ab42c30545e93db4863575e4523269f8f1535dab6938cafed15e1b52", "ja": "ああ、もちろん！　特等席で見てるよ。", "zh": "啊，当然！我会坐在特等席看着的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0353_1015_001har", "source_sha256": "9a013ca5bd9314fe58bc0d30dd08998953156e001b156381cea9286b8bc77eef", "ja": "絶対ですからね！　ふふ……っと、それじゃ私、\nそろそろレッスンに戻りま……わっ、っとっと！？", "zh": "说好了哦！呵呵……啊，那我也该回去训练了……呀，等、等等！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0353_1016_p", "source_sha256": "f47d6cb597d51c24436a112da0b5dbcb6755eb2e15a169d39aca1f992bd98a61", "ja": "春香！？", "zh": "春香！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0353_1017", "source_sha256": "879219f2e9a99f269a98cabd5ce5b3f05fdc56b084d761e81dbdd10b010ddfd2", "ja": "支える", "zh": "支持", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0353_2000_p", "source_sha256": "0d74d465931dc11a4c094cfc2ef83304ac0b429662b8f5ff1dc0a28e5a1f316b", "ja": "よっ、と！　ふぅ……危ない。\n気をつけてな。", "zh": "好，接住了！呼……好险。\n小心点啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0353_2001_001har", "source_sha256": "660b82538bf210546d8fb24d753b81cea0a4dca6f771397dbce9e2e5005987ee", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます……えっと。\nいつまで経っても私、変わらないですね。えへへ……。", "zh": "啊，谢谢……那个。\n不管过了多久，我还是一点没变呢。嘿嘿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0353_2002_p", "source_sha256": "a3a5095ea6b59c8eeaaaa0affe9035dc35ee70dcccbf542872db3b7ac4b6226e", "ja": "（目標に向かって、がむしゃらに進むアイドルたち。\nこれからも、目が離せないな……色々な意味で）", "zh": "（偶像们为了目标，不顾一切地努力前进。今后也不能把视线从她们身上移开啊……从各种意义上来说。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
